  "contentHtml": "<p>2학년 태양계나 3학년 우주 단원 이후</p><p>우주여행 광고지 만들기인데요</p><p>이번에 검정 8절지에 블랙보드마카를 써봤거든요</p><p>그러니깐 아이들이 색감이 예뻐서 그런지&#160;</p><p>흰 도화지보다 반응이 더 좋고 열심히 하더라구요</p><p>학기말 수업으로 정보 공유합니다</p><p>학생 작품도 같이 올려드릴게요</p><p>인터넷에서 블랙보드마카라고 치면 8색에 8천원 정도해요~^^</p><p>하기전에 유튜브 영상 하나보여주고</p><p>여행 일정이나 특별혜택 같은</p><p>상상의 광고지예요</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/1-wmW9A2c6k\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/1-wmW9A2c6k</a></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6aa38f76be526620ef2e44ceec00f9a3f90d7bc5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6aa38f76be526620ef2e44ceec00f9a3f90d7bc5\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b05d594d48a41a08acedfb58c85e8887bae5fb1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b05d594d48a41a08acedfb58c85e8887bae5fb1\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8cfe462e72384f1bd19f6342ef9f116e83b422ef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8cfe462e72384f1bd19f6342ef9f116e83b422ef\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/016d175f9f1508cbca772ef22e4f246072770832\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/016d175f9f1508cbca772ef22e4f246072770832\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div